{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "sha256:0df820f554ab6f35765017b2e17b08d4130e32a03d355ff06cbbacece8184546", "hash": "sha256:0df820f554ab6f35765017b2e17b08d4130e32a03d355ff06cbbacece8184546", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 118555, "byte_start": 117745, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:cc2f842ded16580ac85866201643e084a1535aff8b51b7f6b4ca491cbe419900", "line_end": 3258, "line_start": 3241}, "owner_tag": "06FR", "parent_tag": "06FR", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-descent-remark-list-local-source-target}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-base-change-finite-type}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-descent-lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-type}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-local-source-target}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a25f8e46d658c9936b8db2252054af7765df2ea12a25e8ea84b31767172860e7", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nThe property ``locally of finite type'' of morphisms of algebraic spaces\nis smooth local on the source-and-target, see\nDescent on Spaces, Remark <REF_0001>.\nIt is also stable under base change and fpqc local on the target, see\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0002>\nand\nDescent on Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0003>.\nHence, by\nLemma <REF_0004>\nabove, we may define what it means for a morphism of algebraic spaces\nto be locally of finite type as follows and it agrees with the already\nexisting notion defined in\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0005>\nwhen the morphism is representable by algebraic spaces.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:34d05f26dcb4b5bd883d371ae147769d3b01a458163b38c618b81af739b2ee20", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FR:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:296f8ed6a4912cf5eac6396d02b2bc5000df4bf5c7ab9dd9a28242dd143a9b82", "hash": "sha256:296f8ed6a4912cf5eac6396d02b2bc5000df4bf5c7ab9dd9a28242dd143a9b82", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 119171, "byte_start": 119005, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:b37c617c6270a2a0926a8488324c0956373da7217befc21f92161416510ae9e3", "line_end": 3278, "line_start": 3274}, "owner_tag": "06FT", "parent_tag": "06FR", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06FR", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-composition-finite-type}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f69df73075b58fde4586a03550d56c81984899ec84129e3d1365d20a50124a31", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nThe composition of finite type morphisms is of finite type.\nThe same holds for locally of finite type.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4c732e8372c8a138b9dd19ffbfd7aa37ca847ff5b6e1bf4c5eb879e0a4463135", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FT:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:24de6fd4aa179792367dfd0387f1894956af7b103d6c0f74b2d0f13e5860b7d3", "hash": "sha256:24de6fd4aa179792367dfd0387f1894956af7b103d6c0f74b2d0f13e5860b7d3", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 110543, "byte_start": 109279, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3d947fb3cd19e8423537311ed9adbf370b034046005b268644184dfe001f5a8d", "line_end": 3053, "line_start": 3023}, "owner_tag": "06FM", "parent_tag": "06FL", "requested_label": "stacks-morphisms-lemma-local-source-target", "requested_tag": "06FM", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06FL", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-local-source-target}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU \\ar[d]_a \\ar[r]_h & V \\ar[d]^b \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]^f & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$V$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} V$", "MATH_0007": "$h$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0009": "$a : U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$h$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0014": "$f$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0017": "$f$", "MATH_0018": "$f$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:21d3fd4d2f758f9fce4653914a822ca3045e36c98445eb734d0f4e0d67cd7612", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6c68f124a59818d764bd9bce57c862c39ec73f5f965a4906e46d9bf4052dbae6", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a property of morphisms of algebraic spaces\nwhich is smooth local on the source-and-target.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nConsider commutative diagrams\n<MATH_0003>\nwhere <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are algebraic spaces and the vertical arrows are smooth.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> for any diagram as above such that in addition\n<MATH_0006> is smooth\nthe morphism <MATH_0007> has property <MATH_0008>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for some diagram as above with <MATH_0009> surjective\nthe morphism <MATH_0010> has property <MATH_0011>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nIf <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> are representable by algebraic spaces,\nthen this is also equivalent to <MATH_0014> (as a morphism of algebraic spaces)\nhaving property <MATH_0015>. If <MATH_0016> is also preserved under\nany base change, and fppf local on the base, then for morphisms <MATH_0017>\nwhich are representable by algebraic spaces this\nis also equivalent to <MATH_0018> having property <MATH_0019> in the sense\nof\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:01acdc55192e610ca824e9f704e788e529f66baf029ccdcaa3aaf15bf3910c57", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FM:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:86d49c5a92c95ea835a8e92752a7e79ccefa333dcd4485f85a42b30f48be1a5f", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p039.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:1fc6517e24d7dc351113ab87e2b4eec6848ecc41cb6d49a8acece67d7a852954", "path": "docs/evidence/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p039-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:d0355c21939f01f9704025aea4351de088fd8a3bb4f61840ece9ca5491daa1d3"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:7c4e1984fe4e6b4ae37e01477744ca9f9a46294c", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p039", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a20b62-d902-75f0-a9c7-23598adce928", "unit_id": "tag:06FS:statement"}, "context_hash": "sha256:25fe64e3095b5a4baa2f5bee4a144eb27b42392dcbe37e553dc2c6c4318354d1", "created_at": "2026-11-24T02:29:19.965352+00:00", "glossary_revision": "git:7c4e1984fe4e6b4ae37e01477744ca9f9a46294c", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.171.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.1-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.1-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p039", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p039", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:24b3e7afd9cafd52144106f087c064bd9983f8dd4a3f050328b4b1fb09a1fcac", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "of finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为代数叠（algebraic stacks）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 我们称<MATH_0002>为\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部有限型（locally of finite type）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是指引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>中的等价（equivalent）条件在取\n<MATHSEG_0001>局部有限型（locally of finite type）<MATHSEG_0002>时成立。\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们称<MATH_0003>为\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>有限型（of finite type）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，是指它是局部有限型（locally of finite type）且拟紧（quasi-compact）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:9df3e28b6fdbfbc8dba31556915d8471e7932f218735eef2dcd4c653a2f03706", "unit_id": "tag:06FS:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所定义态射的源与目标所属对象；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "定义中讨论的映射；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "由所引等价条件定义的态射性质；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"context": "定义所引用的数学陈述类型；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"context": "所引用条件之间的逻辑关系；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "由局部有限型与拟紧性共同定义的态射性质；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "of finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "有限型定义中的另一个条件；所提供词表中无已批准词条。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}]}
